001101131996", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628050_2360001104465329_811509019894970622_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=L9nVvxZEVcEQ7kNvwHaWMTN&_nc_oc=Adr4YMIc4Axh_r0b-wSEqKG7C02N2jkauyHBL7vh3lmifpaiPIlMeB-ataPltdjRPPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWkZM1WXzP3LgW-MLig5vWVQHNJKVydeN4yuRGbRYSTQ&oe=6AFB4666"}, "display_name": "Dungeon Maker", "keywords": ["dungeon", "sandbox", "adventure", "passthrough", "builder"], "long_description": "                                                                                                                                                                                                       \n{576958931641921}\n\nSires! __Dungeon Maker__ is a mixed reality sandbox game where you shape the adventure! Take control to build and customize every detail, or effortlessly generate endless dungeons (currently in __BETA__). \n\nWhether you create by hand or let the system do the work, prepare to explore traps, face enemies, and uncover quests in your own immersive dungeons.\n\nThis is a work-in-progress with regular updates and fixes. \n\nJoin my Discord to share feedback and ideas: www.DUNGEON-MAKER.com\n# -\n# GENERATE INFINITE DUNGEONS!  (BETA)\nThe dungeon foundation is created from your Meta rooms setup, then generate as many dungeons as you like!\n{1964062794072551}\n\n# SET DEADLY TRAPS AND QUESTS\nPlenty of traps and quest items to place around your home. Keys and doors, plots and treasures, deadly pits, swinging axes, skeletons!\n{884487527165107}\n\n# FIND THE TREASURE!\nCan you go deep enough into the dungeon to retrieve the treasure?\n{492385469938846}", "short_description": "Generate your own Dungeon in your home using Passthrough!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy.fieldof.vision/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Field Of Vision", "support_web